            "value": {
              "html": "<p>Ре­ши­те не­ра­вен­ство  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{x^{3}+x^{2}-x-1}{4^{x^{2}}-8\\cdot 2^{x^{2}}+16}\\ge 0\"></span>. </p>",
